{
  "name": "Slack Channel Archiver",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 1 * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Monthly Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://slack.com/api/conversations.list",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "types",
              "value": "public_channel"
            },
            {
              "name": "exclude_archived",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "200"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{ $credentials.slackApi.accessToken }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "List All Channels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst channels = items[0].json.channels || [];\nconst now = Date.now() / 1000;\nconst ninetyDays = 90 * 24 * 60 * 60;\n\nconst protectedChannels = ['general', 'random', 'announcements', 'incidents'];\n\nconst staleChannels = channels.filter(ch => {\n  if (protectedChannels.includes(ch.name)) return false;\n  const lastActivity = ch.updated || ch.created || 0;\n  return (now - lastActivity) > ninetyDays;\n});\n\nreturn staleChannels.map(ch => ({\n  json: {\n    channelId: ch.id,\n    channelName: ch.name,\n    memberCount: ch.num_members || 0,\n    lastActivity: new Date((ch.updated || ch.created) * 1000).toISOString(),\n    daysSinceActivity: Math.round((now - (ch.updated || ch.created)) / (24 * 60 * 60)),\n    archivedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "name": "Find Inactive Channels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.daysSinceActivity }}",
              "rightValue": 90,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "If Inactive 90 Days",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [920, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "channel",
        "operation": "archive",
        "channelId": "={{ $json.channelId }}"
      },
      "name": "Archive Channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1140, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Archived Channels",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1360, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#admin-log",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":file_cabinet: *Channel Archived:* #{{ $json.channelName }}\n*Members:* {{ $json.memberCount }} | *Inactive:* {{ $json.daysSinceActivity }} days",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Notify Admin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1580, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack Channel Archiver\n\nMonthly cleanup of inactive Slack channels.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Monthly trigger (1st of month)\n2. List all public channels via API\n3. Filter channels inactive 90+ days\n4. Skip protected channels (general, random, etc.)\n5. Archive inactive channels\n6. Log to Google Sheets\n7. Post notification to #admin-log\n\n**Protected channels:** general, random, announcements, incidents",
        "width": 340,
        "height": 300
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [20, 260]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Monthly Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List All Channels",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List All Channels": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Find Inactive Channels",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Find Inactive Channels": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "If Inactive 90 Days",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "If Inactive 90 Days": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Archive Channel",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Archive Channel": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Log to Sheets": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Notify Admin",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}